{"id":"d3b87736727e237a","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation.md","title":"73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation — space hierarchy notation","display":"73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation — space hierarchy notation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation","display":"73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation — space hierarchy notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]","[[73-thm-work-space-hierarchy]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation","73-theorem-7.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation — space hierarchy notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8346a921772e7ddf\" href=\"?note=8346a921772e7ddf\" title=\"73-df-space-complexity-notation\">73-df-space-complexity-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"708dbbb6cfe69b79\" href=\"?note=708dbbb6cfe69b79\" title=\"73-thm-work-space-hierarchy\">73-thm-work-space-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-space-hierarchy-notation</span><span>73-theorem-7.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SpaceConstr},\\mathrm{SPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{SpaceConstr},\\mathrm{SPACE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8346a921772e7ddf\" href=\"?note=8346a921772e7ddf\" title=\"73-df-space-complexity-notation\">73-df-space-complexity-notation</a>；二者采用同一只读输入工作空间模型。</li>\n<li>函数的可构造性和对数下界都写入前件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subsetneq\">\\(\\subsetneq\\)</span> 保留通常的真包含含义，而非只存在一个差集元素。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le f(n))\n\\land(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;bf(n)\\le ag(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le f(n))\n\\land(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;bf(n)\\le ag(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land L\\notin\\mathrm{SPACE}(f))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land L\\notin\\mathrm{SPACE}(f))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-work-space-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"708dbbb6cfe69b79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-work-space-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\mathrm{SpaceConstr},\\mathrm{SPACE}$ 见 [[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]；二者采用同一只读输入工作空间模型。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SpaceConstr},\\mathrm{SPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\subsetneq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le f(n))\n\\land(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;bf(n)\\le ag(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land L\\notin\\mathrm{SPACE}(f))","display":true}],"bytes":1414,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8346a921772e7ddf","708dbbb6cfe69b79"]}